IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-ALGOL61-RETENTION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-MAX-C-BYTE-LIMIT  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-SOURCE-METRICS.
   05 D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-ALGOL-COUNT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-GATING-DETENT.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-SHADOW-BYTES      PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 68000 TO D0-MAX-C-BYTE-LIMIT.
    MOVE 45000 TO D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES.
    MOVE 60 TO D1-ALGOL-COUNT.

    PERFORM STAGE-RETENTION-EVAL.
    PERFORM EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D2-SHADOW-BYTES == D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES AND D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES <= D0-MAX-C-BYTE-LIMIT
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 2 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-RETENTION-EVAL.
    MOVE D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES TO D2-SHADOW-BYTES.
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 875 + ((125 * (68000 - D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES)) / 68000).
    EXIT.

EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = (((D1-C-SOURCE-BYTES * 1000) + D1-ALGOL-COUNT) * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 1000.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
